  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, the graph of \\(2x + 7y = 28\\) crosses the \\(x\\)-axis at the point \\((a, 0)\\). What is the value of \\(a\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "14"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "On the \\(x\\)-axis, \\(y = 0\\): \\(2a = 28\\).",
    "So \\(a = 14\\)."
